__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"default",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return u}});var o=r(d[0]);r(d[1]);var t=r(d[2]),n=r(d[3]);const s=[{heading:'Who we are',body:'Sobat is a meeting layer for shared cabs: we help people going the same way find each other, meet up, and split a fare they arrange and pay for themselves. We don\u2019t operate vehicles, employ drivers, or process payments. Sobat is operated by [Company/Entity Name], [registered address].'},{heading:'What we collect',body:'To run the matching and safety features described below, we collect:',bullets:['Your phone number and email address.','Your first and last name, profile photo, date of birth and gender. Riders you share a ride with see your first name, photo and an age range worked out from your date of birth. They never see your last name, date of birth, phone number or email.','A coarse profession category, if you choose to add one.','Pickup and drop points for rides you start or join, and your device location when you use \u201ccurrent location\u201d or look for rides leaving near you.','The routes people search, kept only as a daily count per area of about 1 km, with nothing that identifies who searched.','If you verify your identity: the result from our licensed verification provider (pass or fail only). We never store your ID number or a copy of your ID document.','Messages you send in a ride\u2019s chat, ratings you give or receive, and reports you file.','A push-notification token (phone apps) or your browser\u2019s notification address (web app), if you allow notifications.','Whether you want Sobat\u2019s news by email (the switch at sign-up). You can unsubscribe at any time, in one click, from any of our emails.','If you look around without signing in: your network (IP) address, only in scrambled form and only to stop automated abuse. It\u2019s deleted within two days and never linked to an account.']},{heading:'What stays on your phone',body:'Your saved Home and Work places and your recent places are stored only on your phone. They\u2019re never uploaded. We only see a place when you search for, start or join a ride with it.'},{heading:'Why we collect it',body:'Only to show you rides going your way, put you in a ride with compatible riders, help you meet up, notify you about your rides, let riders rate each other, and contact you about your account or a safety report. We don\u2019t use your data for advertising, and we don\u2019t sell it.'},{heading:'Who sees what',body:'Before you join a ride, other riders see only facts about it: where and when it goes, how many seats are left, and its riders\u2019 average rating. They never see who is in it. Once you\u2019re in a ride together, its riders see each other\u2019s first name, photo, age range, profession and rating. A ride\u2019s chat is visible only to its riders. If a ride\u2019s first rider chose to approve who joins, asking to join shows them your first name, photo, rating and where you get on and off, so they can decide.'},{heading:'Safety reviews',body:'When a rider files a report, a small number of Sobat staff review it. To do that they can see the reported ride\u2019s chat and riders, and the ride history, ratings and past reports of the people involved. Phone numbers and email addresses stay hidden unless a reviewer needs to contact someone about the report, and each time one is shown, that is recorded. Staff can warn a rider, suspend an account for a set time or until further notice (a suspended rider can\u2019t start or join rides or chat), cancel a ride used for abuse, or delete an account when the law requires it. Staff sign in with two-step verification.\n\nEvery action our staff take is written to an audit log: who did it, what they did, to which account or ride, why, when, and a scrambled form of their network address. Nobody can change or delete its entries, including us. If an account is deleted, the log keeps only an internal account number, not the person\u2019s name or contact details, so we can show how a safety or legal matter was handled.'},{heading:'Emails we send',body:'We email you about your account only: a welcome when you finish signing up, a note if our team warns you, suspends your account or lifts a suspension, and a last note confirming it when your account is deleted. If you chose Sobat news, you get that too, and each of those emails has a one-click unsubscribe link that works without signing in. Our emails have no tracking: no images or pixels that tell us you opened them, and no tracked links. We send them with Google Workspace (Gmail), from noreply@getsobat.in; replies go to support@getsobat.in.\n\nWhen a rider files a report, our team gets an email saying so, with a link to it, but without anyone\u2019s name or what the report says. If you unsubscribe, we keep your address, marked as unsubscribed, only so we never email it again.'},{heading:'Who we share it with',body:'We use a few service providers to run the app, each processing only what it needs: Supabase (our database, sign-in and live updates), WhatsApp from Meta (sending verification codes), our SMS provider (verification codes), Google (Google sign-in and place search), your phone\u2019s own maps service from Apple or Google (to name a point you drop on the map), OpenStreetMap (maps in the web app), Cloudflare (a bot check on our website\u2019s forms and web sign-in), Expo (push notifications on phones), your browser\u2019s push service (notifications in the web app), and, once available, our identity verification provider. None of them may use your data for their own purposes.'},{heading:'How long we keep it',bullets:['A ride\u2019s chat is deleted 30 days after the ride ends, unless a report about that ride is still open: then it\u2019s kept until the report has been handled.','Entries in our staff audit log are kept for [audit log retention period].','Exact pickup and drop points are rounded to an area of about 1 km 30 days after a ride ends. We keep that area-level history for your ride list and our statistics.','Your account and everything linked to it is deleted when you delete your account.','If an account is suspended, banned by our team or reported when it\u2019s deleted, we keep one-way fingerprints (hashes) of its email address, phone numbers and Google account ID, and the reports about it, for up to two years. They can\u2019t be turned back into the address or number; we use them only to stop a banned person signing up again and to keep safety reports tied to them. If that person signs up again, the reports are linked to the new account, and a banned person\u2019s new account starts suspended.','Copies of the emails we send are deleted after 7 days. The one confirming an account\u2019s deletion is deleted as soon as it\u2019s sent.']},{heading:'Your rights',body:'Under India\u2019s Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you can ask us what data we hold about you, correct it, or ask us to delete it. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from Profile \u2192 Delete account, or on our website at getsobat.in/delete-account.html, or contact us at [grievance officer email].'},{heading:'Age',body:'Sobat is for users 18 and older. We don\u2019t knowingly collect data from anyone younger.'},{heading:'Grievance officer',body:'[Grievance Officer Name]\n[Email]\n[Address]'},{heading:'Changes',body:'If this policy changes materially, we\u2019ll let you know in the app before the change takes effect.'},{heading:'Governing law',body:'This policy is governed by the laws of India.'}];function u(){const u=(0,o.c)(1);let h;return u[0]===Symbol.for("react.memo_cache_sentinel")?(h=(0,n.jsx)(t.LegalPage,{title:"Privacy Policy",sections:s}),u[0]=h):h=u[0],h}},781,[793,12,910,6]);